            <ArticleTitle>Tetralogy of Fallot with acquired coronary artery disease-An unusual presentation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>725-729</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1111/jocs.12851</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Coronary artery disease developing in tetralogy of Fallot (TOF) is rare. We report a rare case of TOF with acquired coronary artery disease, treated simultaneously with intra cardiac repair and multi vessel coronary artery bypass grafting.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>© 2016 Wiley Periodicals, Inc.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
